# Markdown is formatted by hand in this project.
#
# Prettier normalises every unordered list marker to "-" and every thematic
# break to "---". Both are hyphens, and this project's writing convention uses
# "*" for bullets and no thematic breaks at all. Prettier offers no option to
# change either behaviour, so the documentation is excluded from it instead.
#
# Source code is still formatted normally.

